          "correction": "Correct the native wire serializer/deserializer to the observed payload envelope; replace the new synthetic fixtures and round-trip assertion with that envelope, and keep malformed required fields/types fail-closed. Rebuild the affected Spike artifact and rerun the focused native/parser positive and negative checks plus required common-fixture A/B. Correct the implementation/provenance claims in README/CR; do not alter the old execution/review facts or promote to S2 on the present evidence."
